---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Irving College Baptist Church">
  <main class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Irving College Baptist Church</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="updated">Effective September 29, 2026</p>

      <p>
        This Privacy Policy explains how Irving College Baptist Church ("ICBC," "we," "us," or "our")
        handles information in connection with the official Irving College Baptist Church Roku app and
        the streaming services used by the app.
      </p>

      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        The ICBC Roku app does not require you to create an account or sign in. We do not use the app to
        ask for your name, email address, mailing address, payment information, or other information that
        directly identifies you.
      </p>
      <p>
        When the app connects to our streaming server, standard technical information may be recorded
        automatically in server logs. This may include an IP address, date and time of a request, requested
        media or URL, device or software information supplied with the request, and technical error or
        diagnostic information.
      </p>

      <h2>How We Use Information</h2>
      <p>
        Technical information is used to deliver livestreams and sermon videos, maintain and secure our
        streaming service, diagnose playback or server problems, and understand general service performance.
      </p>

      <h2>Advertising and Sale of Personal Information</h2>
      <p>
        The ICBC Roku app does not contain paid advertising, and ICBC does not sell personal information
        collected through the app or use app activity for targeted advertising.
      </p>

      <h2>Roku Platform Information</h2>
      <p>
        The app runs on the Roku platform. Roku may collect information about Roku devices, app usage, and
        platform activity under Roku's own privacy practices. Information collected independently by Roku is
        governed by Roku's policies rather than this Privacy Policy.
      </p>

      <h2>Data Retention and Security</h2>
      <p>
        We retain technical information only for as long as reasonably necessary for operation, security,
        troubleshooting, and legitimate administrative purposes. We use reasonable measures to protect the
        systems used to provide the app and streaming service, but no internet-connected system can be
        guaranteed to be completely secure.
      </p>

      <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        The ICBC Roku app is a general-audience church app and is not directed specifically to children. We do
        not knowingly collect personal information from children through the app.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy as our app or streaming services change. The effective date at the
        top of this page will be updated when changes are made.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this Privacy Policy may be sent to
        <a href="mailto:thecollegepastor83@gmail.com">thecollegepastor83@gmail.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    background: #f7f8f7;
    color: #202624;
    padding: 72px 20px 90px;
  }

  .legal-wrap {
    width: min(860px, 100%);
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: clamp(28px, 5vw, 58px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    color: #2d8b68;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.6rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  .updated {
    margin: 12px 0 34px;
    color: #69736f;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 34px 0 10px;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
  }

  p {
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  a {
    color: #237a5a;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
